WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
BUILD 019. 100 ALERTS ≠ 100 INCIDENTS.. Repeated signals can describe one consequential event—not one hundred separate interruptions.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
CORRELATE. GROUP THE EVIDENCE FIRST.. Shared keys collapse repeated signals while preserving every source and state.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
ASSESS. SCORE CONSEQUENCE TRANSPARENTLY.. Severity, scale, rights, reversibility, evidence, and inherited friction remain inspectable.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
ROUTE. AUTHORITY BEFORE AVAILABILITY.. Notify only an authorized owner through a compatible channel, with the reason visible.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
ACKNOWLEDGE. MISSED CLOCK → NAMED BACKUP.. A recorded acknowledgement stops the timeout; otherwise a validated backup receives the chain.

6
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
SAVE THIS. AUTHORITY · EVIDENCE · TIME · RECOURSE. Escalation is an accountable chain—not a louder notification.

